            "sid": "2SA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa Ishiboshetsi waSaulo yahulila shinga Abineri olwa yali nafwilile eHeberoni, amakhonoke katubukha, abaIsiraeli bosi nibahenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Ishiboshetsi waSaulo yali nende abandu babili abali abaseesia betsing'anda; eliira lioundi niye Baana, neliira lioundi niye Rekhabu, abaana baRimoni, omuBeerotsi, owomubaBenyamini; okhuba Beerotsi nashio shibasibwa mbu neshiaBenyamini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne abaBeerotsi beelukha nibatsia eGitaimu, ne bashimenyibungwakhwoyo okhuula olwa leelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yonatsani waSaulo yali nende omwanawe omusiani owalema eshilenje. Yali nali owemiyika chiraano olwa amakhuwa kaSaulo nende Yonatsani keetsa okhurula eYezereeli, omuleliwe naye namuchinga, niyeelukha; ne olwa yali natetekhananga okhwilukha, omwana yakwa, mana nalema. Neliiralie niye Mefiboshetsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baRimoni omuBeerotsi, mbu Rekhabu nende Baana, nibatsia, niboola ebunanzu waIshiboshetsi khushise shia isenya niyihangaale, olwa yali nahuluukhanga mushiteere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, omukhasi owali nalindanga omuliango kweinzu yali nasesanga ingano; ne yarenjetsa, tsindoolo nitsimuyila; mana Rekhabu nende Baana omwana wabwe nibeenjila munzu masilisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa beenjila munzu, naye Ishiboshetsi nakonile khushitalishie mushisika shiokhukona, bamufumira nibamwira, nibamurema omurwe, nibabukula omurwekwe nibatsiila khunjila yaAraba eshilo tulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamuleerela Daudi omurwe kwaIshiboshetsi eHeberoni, nibasuniila omuruchi bari Omurwe kwaIshiboshetsi waSaulo omusukuwo, owayimanga obulamubwo, ngwokuno; OMWAMI amaliile omwami wanje omuruchi eshikwoli inyanga yino khuSaulo nende olwibulolwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi nakalusia Rekhabu nende Baana omwana wabwe, abaana baRimoni omuBeerotsi, nabasunjila ari Shinga OMWAMI olwa abeetsanga mwoyo, owanunuule obulamu bwanje mumanyakhano kosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olwa oundi yamboolela ari Lola, Saulo ufwile, nakaala mbu yandeereele amakhuwa amalayi, nasi nimuhamba nimwirila eZikilagi; ako niko amatani aka ndamuheelesia khulwa amakhuwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano, olwa abandu abamayaanu beerile omundu omulunjishi munzu yiye omwene, khushitalishie. Shindalashila okhwenya amabangake khumakhono keenywe, nimuyinia mushialo, ni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rho Daudi yalaka abasooliilibe, nabo nibabeera, nibarema amakhono kabwe nende ebilenje biabwe, nibabahanikha ahambi nende litiba elili muHeberoni. Habula babukula omurwe kwaIshiboshetsi, nibakuyabila mung'ani yaAbineri, eHeberoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
